@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  usecase "FAFR003: View Predictive Analytics for Clients" as FAFR003
  usecase "CFR002: Receive Alerts on Anomalous Transactions" as CFR002
  usecase "CFR004: Personalized Recommendations Based on Financial Profile" as CFR004
  usecase "SAFR005: Request Spending Limit Alerts from AI Component" as SAFR005
  usecase "SFR013: Generate Client Alerts Based on Predefined Conditions" as SFR013
  usecase "CFR006: View Spent Limit Exceedance Alerts" as CFR006
  usecase "FAFR002: Manage Client Intervention Alerts" as FAFR002
  usecase "SFR007: Request Investment Opportunity Analysis from AI Component" as SFR007
  usecase "CFR011: Send Feedback to Improve System Outputs" as CFR011

  client --> CFR001 : View financial data and insights consolidated in a single dashboard.
  sysAdmin --> SAFR001 : Configure system parameters for accuracy, relevance, and compliance with regulations like Basel III.
  advisor --> FAFR003 : Review predictive analytics about clients' financial situations to provide guidance during consultations.
  client --> CFR002 : Receive real-time alerts on unusual transactions in accounts per FATF standards.
  client --> CFR004 : Get personalized recommendations aligned with their financial profile and goals, optimized for investment portfolio management.
  sysAdmin --> SAFR005 : Request spending limit alerts when user exceeds defined thresholds to maintain budget control.
  system --> SFR013 : Ensure timely delivery of critical financial event notifications via appropriate channels.
  client --> CFR006 : View alerts indicating exceedance of predefined spending limits in specific categories for better expense management.
  advisor --> FAFR002 : Monitor and manage intervention alerts triggered by the AI to proactively address clients' potential issues.
  system --> SFR007 : Identify suitable investment opportunities based on client risk profiles, market trends, and ESG preferences.
  user --> CFR011 : Provide feedback to enhance future outputs of recommendations and insights.

}

@enduml